@startuml
title GitForge V1.0.0 - Repository Visibility Change
start
:Receive visibility change request;
:Resolve authenticated User;
:Resolve repository;
if (Caller is owner?) then (yes)
    :Validate target visibility;
    if (Target visibility valid?) then (yes)
        :Persist new visibility;
        :Use new authorization semantics;
        :Return success;
    else (no)
        :Return validation failure;
    endif
else (no)
    :Deny;
endif
stop
@enduml
